From eb49c7a0f1c9430156094effa61df83174bc4423 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Magnus Reimann <magnus.reimann@mailbox.org>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:52:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH gnumach 20/22] tests: add test-clock, check that the uptime
 clock never goes backwards

Threads on all processors read host_get_uptime64 in a loop and check
that the time they see never decreases.

* tests/test-clock.c: New file.
* tests/user-qemu.mk (USER_TESTS): Add tests/test-clock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tests/test-clock.c | 143 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/user-qemu.mk |   1 +
 2 files changed, 144 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tests/test-clock.c

diff --git a/tests/test-clock.c b/tests/test-clock.c
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..03b30e85
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/test-clock.c
@@ -0,0 +1,143 @@
+/*
+ *  Copyright (C) 2026 Free Software Foundation
+ *
